<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Digital Microwave started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Digital Microwave started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Digital Microwave Corp with a buy recommendation, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to elaborate.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/4 to 23-3/4 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
